<title>FINLAND: LONG HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE AT FIX.</title>
<headline>LONG HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Long Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>rose at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday. The</p>
<p>three-month rose one basis point to 3.06 percent.</p>
<p>				     Oct 24 fix	     Oct 23 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.01 pct		3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.03 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.06 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.15 pct		3.14 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.26 pct		3.23 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.37 pct		3.33 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
